[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17760.47, "timestamp": "04:56:00", "text": "是啊，我自己的问题让我意识到现实的残酷。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17764.07, "timestamp": "04:56:04", "text": "嗨。回来了。对不起。所以，嗯，很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17768.31, "timestamp": "04:56:08", "text": "有些人想方设法屏蔽我之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17770.628, "timestamp": "04:56:10", "text": "J Cole的一首歌里有一句歌词是这样的："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17773.43, "timestamp": "04:56:13", "text": "大概是这样的，“好吧，这么多人……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17774.868, "timestamp": "04:56:14", "text": "所有人都想拉黑我，又想加我好友。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17776.628, "timestamp": "04:56:16", "text": "东西。”所以，他们没法回复我的短信。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17778.31, "timestamp": "04:56:18", "text": "正确的？或者加我好友吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17781.35, "timestamp": "04:56:21", "text": "正确的？就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17783.19, "timestamp": "04:56:23", "text": "别提她。她不想这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17786.07, "timestamp": "04:56:26", "text": "已保存。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17793.51, "timestamp": "04:56:33", "text": "呃，这不是你的工作，你没必要去改变别人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17796.708, "timestamp": "04:56:36", "text": "是的，没错。这不是我的工作。确切地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17799.51, "timestamp": "04:56:39", "text": "我不是心理治疗师。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17801.43, "timestamp": "04:56:41", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17806.47, "timestamp": "04:56:46", "text": "不知道这是否符合准社会行为的定义。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17809.67, "timestamp": "04:56:49", "text": "不，不是。我认为不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17811.19, "timestamp": "04:56:51", "text": "我不认为不是。我们只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17813.59, "timestamp": "04:56:53", "text": "进行对话。我们正在谈论"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17816.708, "timestamp": "04:56:56", "text": "随机话题。 [笑声]"}]